	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad te foliatas literas, charissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et eas ad te misi per <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinum</placeName> quendam studiosum; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>adiunxi etiam scriptum quoddam optimi viri <persName ref="p2899">Mathię <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Schenckhii</persName>, quo se defendit a calumniis et conviciis nostrorum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ubiquistarum, qui pergunt in errore Eutiches plantando, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>inculcando et mordicus tenendo, homines indocti <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>plane, commessatores edaces, harpyię rapacissimae magnas <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>in nostra ecclesia turbas excitant, ... atque toti <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>colluviei peswiticę portam adperiunt neque hiscere <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>audent adversus hostes Christi, qui aperte in <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nostra civitate Christum blasphemias detonant et <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>eo promoverunt posowichtę, ut precipuas et Croesum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>divitiis superantes antea evangelio propensissimas [<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>personas] captivas ducant et adegerunt, ut magna sollicitudine <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>curent alias vicinitate, affinitate et sanguine iunctas <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>mulieres illaqueent.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Confitentur peccata et in sinum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nefandissimi canis omni septimana effundant, singulis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mensibus bis communicent.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ad hec... sunt nostri; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sed in fratres seviunt atrociter, coelum terrę miscent <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>pro sua ubiquitate.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Literas hasce cum acceperis cum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>apo<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>logia <persName ref="p2899">Schenckhii</persName>, quam remitti cupio, rogo me certiorem <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>facias.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l619">Bavaria</placeName> visitationem in libros et parrochos <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>instituerunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Prodiit dialogus, in quo <persName>Philippus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ad infernum detruditur; interlocutores sunt, <persName ref="p2411">Ott-Heinrichus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName>Mauricius</persName> electores, <persName>Albertus</persName> marchio et alii plerique, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>qui apud inferos contendunt, quod misere sunt <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>seducti.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Pontifex anxius est pro <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>impetrando consilio.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Plura scriberem, si tuto liceret; quam primum intellexero <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>te meas accepisse, scribam liberius et uberius.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>d. <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName>, <persName ref="p3988">Wolphium</persName> et <persName ref="p8011">Gvalt[h]erum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ocyssime 18. octobris ano etc. 54.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p2856">Geryon</persName> t[uus].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo atque doctissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, theologo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pientissimo et pastori vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>d. et amico charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
